報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 46.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.12"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":27.29,"default_fair_val":27.29,"premium_pct":126.8,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":26.5,"pe_forward":23.3,"pb_trailing":2.2,"pb_forward":2,"div_yield":4.54,"ps_ratio":4.9,"fcf_to_ev":3.7,"fcf_to_mcap":5.07,"liab_to_assets":46.3,"cash_to_assets":0.2,"current_ratio":0.12,"roe":8.3,"roa":4.3,"moat":{"ticker":"VMRK","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"VMRK 在住宅房地產領域的品牌定價能力相對有限。雖然公司致力於提供高品質的居住體驗，但其品牌效應並未達到能顯著區隔市場、大幅提高租金定價的程度。與頂級奢侈品牌或必需消費品不同，住宅租賃市場的客戶對價格較為敏感，品牌忠誠度也相對較低。公司面臨眾多競爭對手，其品牌價值更多體現在服務和設施上，而非能夠支撐顯著溢價的強勢品牌壁壘。因此，其定價權受到市場供需和競爭壓力的制約，得分中等。","comment_en":"VMRK's brand pricing power in the residential real estate sector is relatively limited. While the company strives to offer a high-quality living experience, its brand effect has not reached a level that significantly differentiates the market or allows for substantial rent increases. Unlike top luxury brands or essential consumer goods, customers in the residential rental market are more price-sensitive, and brand loyalty is relatively low. The company faces numerous competitors, and its brand value is more reflected in services and amenities rather than a strong brand barrier that can support significant premiums. Therefore, its pricing power is constrained by market supply and demand and competitive pressures, resulting in a moderate score."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"住宅房地產 REIT 業務本質上不依賴專利或特許經營權來建立競爭壁壘。VMRK 的業務模式屬於高度標準化，其運營主要依循行業規範和地方性法規。沒有獨特的技術專利或政府授予的特許權能夠阻止競爭者進入或模仿其商業模式。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，VMRK 的得分極低，幾乎不存在此類護城河。","comment_en":"The business of residential real estate REITs inherently does not rely on patents or exclusive licenses to establish competitive moats. VMRK's business model is highly standardized, and its operations primarily follow industry norms and local regulations. There are no unique technological patents or government-granted franchises that can prevent competitors from entering or imitating its business model. Consequently, VMRK scores extremely low in terms of patent and regulatory barriers, as such moats are virtually non-existent."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"住宅租賃的轉換成本對 VMRK 而言屬於中等偏低水平。雖然搬家本身會產生時間、金錢和精力成本，但相較於企業級軟體或金融服務，租戶更換住所的決策相對容易。租戶可能會因為租金、地理位置、設施或服務的變化而選擇搬離。VMRK 透過提供良好的居住體驗和設施來試圖提高租戶黏性，但這些努力並不能形成一道堅固的轉換壁壘，足以讓租戶因成本考量而長期留下。因此，轉換成本的護城河效應有限。","comment_en":"The switching costs for residential rentals are moderate to low for VMRK. Although moving itself incurs costs in terms of time, money, and effort, tenants can relatively easily decide to change residences compared to enterprise software or financial services. Tenants may choose to move due to changes in rent, location, amenities, or services. VMRK attempts to increase tenant stickiness by providing a good living experience and facilities, but these efforts do not form a strong switching barrier sufficient to retain tenants solely based on cost considerations. Therefore, the moat effect from switching costs is limited."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"VMRK 的住宅房地產業務幾乎不存在網絡效應。網絡效應通常發生在產品或服務的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而提升的市場，例如社交媒體或拍賣平台。在單一住宅物業的租賃中，租戶之間的互動非常有限，且不會直接提升物業的價值或吸引力。即使是多個物業組合，也難以形成顯著的網絡效應。因此，此維度幾乎沒有護城河可言。","comment_en":"VMRK's residential real estate business exhibits virtually no network effects. Network effects typically occur in markets where the value of a product or service increases with the number of users, such as social media or auction platforms. In the rental of a single residential property, interactions between tenants are very limited and do not directly enhance the property's value or attractiveness. Even with a portfolio of multiple properties, it is difficult to form significant network effects. Therefore, there is almost no moat in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"VMRK 作為一個大型住宅 REIT，在規模經濟方面具有一定的成本優勢。透過集中採購、統一管理和標準化運營流程，公司能夠降低單位物業的運營和維護成本。例如，大規模的採購能獲得更好的價格，統一的物業管理系統能提高效率。然而，房地產行業的規模效應相對有限，因為每個物業的地理位置和市場條件不同，難以實現像製造業那樣的顯著成本差異。其成本優勢主要體現在運營效率上，而非生產成本。","comment_en":"As a large residential REIT, VMRK possesses certain cost advantages in terms of economies of scale. Through centralized procurement, unified management, and standardized operational processes, the company can reduce the operating and maintenance costs per property. For instance, large-scale purchasing can secure better prices, and a unified property management system can improve efficiency. However, the economies of scale in the real estate industry are relatively limited, as each property's location and market conditions differ, making it difficult to achieve significant cost differences like those in manufacturing. Its cost advantage is primarily reflected in operational efficiency rather than production costs."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VMRK 在特定地理區域的資產佈局可能構成一定的護城河。如果公司在需求強勁、供應有限的熱門地區擁有大量優質物業，那麼這些地理位置的稀缺性將帶來競爭優勢。這些黃金地段的物業難以被競爭對手複製，尤其是在城市核心區域或具有獨特生活便利性的地點。這種地理優勢能夠支持較高的租金水平和較低的空置率，形成一種基於地點的壁壘。然而，房地產市場的週期性也可能影響其穩定性。","comment_en":"VMRK's asset allocation in specific geographic areas may constitute a certain moat. If the company owns a significant number of high-quality properties in desirable locations with strong demand and limited supply, the scarcity of these locations will provide a competitive advantage. Properties in these prime locations are difficult for competitors to replicate, especially in urban core areas or places with unique lifestyle conveniences. This geographical advantage can support higher rental rates and lower vacancy rates, forming a location-based barrier. However, the cyclical nature of the real estate market may also affect its stability."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"VMRK 在營運效率方面展現出較強的實力，這得益於其作為大型 REIT 的規模和專業管理。公司能夠透過標準化的租賃流程、高效的物業維護體系以及精準的市場分析來優化運營。有效的成本控制和資源配置，加上對租戶需求的快速響應，有助於維持較高的入住率和租金收益。這種卓越的營運能力，雖然不直接等同於巴菲特式的特許經營權，但在高度競爭的房地產市場中，確實能為公司帶來持續的競爭優勢，得分較高。","comment_en":"VMRK demonstrates considerable strength in operational efficiency, benefiting from its scale as a large REIT and professional management. The company can optimize operations through standardized leasing processes, efficient property maintenance systems, and precise market analysis. Effective cost control and resource allocation, coupled with rapid response to tenant needs, help maintain high occupancy rates and rental income. While this operational excellence is not directly equivalent to a Buffett-style franchise, it does provide a sustained competitive advantage in the highly competitive real estate market, earning a relatively high score."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VMRK 在資本配置方面表現出一定的紀律性，這對於 REIT 來說至關重要。公司需要平衡股息支付、債務償還和再投資於物業組合之間的關係。從其財務數據來看，公司似乎在尋求穩定的現金流和適度的增長。儘管其 ROE 和 ROA 並非頂尖，但相較於行業平均水平，其資本配置決策可能相對審慎。然而，與巴菲特所欣賞的那些能夠持續以高資本回報率進行再投資的公司相比，仍有提升空間。其資本配置策略的有效性是其護城河的重要組成部分。","comment_en":"VMRK exhibits a degree of discipline in capital allocation, which is crucial for a REIT. The company needs to balance dividend payments, debt repayment, and reinvestment in its property portfolio. Based on its financial data, the company appears to be pursuing stable cash flow and moderate growth. Although its ROE and ROA are not top-tier, its capital allocation decisions may be relatively prudent compared to industry averages. However, there is still room for improvement compared to companies that Buffett admires for their ability to consistently reinvest at high rates of capital return. The effectiveness of its capital allocation strategy is an important component of its moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"VMRK 在客戶（租戶）保留方面取得中等成效。透過提供優質的物業管理、及時的維修服務和良好的社區氛圍，公司能夠鼓勵租戶續約。良好的租戶關係和滿意度是維持穩定現金流的關鍵。然而，住宅租賃市場的本質決定了租戶的流動性較高，尤其是在租賃合約到期時。VMRK 的努力旨在降低這種流動性，但其客戶保留率可能仍受市場租金波動和租戶個人情況的影響。因此，其客戶保留的壁壘效應屬於中等。","comment_en":"VMRK achieves moderate success in customer (tenant) retention. By providing quality property management, timely maintenance services, and a good community atmosphere, the company encourages lease renewals. Good tenant relationships and satisfaction are key to maintaining stable cash flow. However, the nature of the residential rental market dictates relatively high tenant turnover, especially at lease expiration. VMRK's efforts aim to reduce this turnover, but its customer retention rate may still be influenced by market rent fluctuations and tenants' personal circumstances. Therefore, the barrier effect of its customer retention is moderate."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"VMRK 的業務模式具有一定的持久性，這主要歸因於住宅租賃作為基本需求的穩定性。人們總是需要居住的地方，這使得住宅房地產市場具有相對穩定的基本面。儘管市場會經歷週期性波動，但長期來看，對住房的需求是持續存在的。VMRK 的資產（房地產）本身具有實體價值和長期使用壽命。只要公司能夠有效管理其物業並適應市場變化，其業務就能在較長時間內保持穩健。然而，需要警惕新興的居住模式和技術變革對傳統租賃市場的潛在顛覆。","comment_en":"VMRK's business model possesses a degree of durability, primarily due to the stability of residential rental as a fundamental need. People always require places to live, giving the residential real estate market relatively stable fundamentals. Although the market experiences cyclical fluctuations, the demand for housing persists in the long run. VMRK's assets (real estate) inherently have intrinsic value and a long useful life. As long as the company can effectively manage its properties and adapt to market changes, its business can remain robust for an extended period. However, caution is warranted regarding potential disruptions to the traditional rental market from emerging living models and technological changes."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"VMRK 的經濟護城河整體呈現中等偏上的水平，主要依賴於其在特定地理區域的資產佈局（M6）和卓越的營運效率（M7）。作為一個大型住宅 REIT，其規模經濟（M5）和相對穩健的資本配置（M8）也提供了一定的競爭優勢。然而，公司在品牌定價權（M1）、轉換成本（M3）、網絡效應（M4）以及客戶保留（M9）方面壁壘較為薄弱。其業務模式的持久性（M10）得益於住房的基本需求，但缺乏專利或特許經營權（M2）的保護。總體而言，VMRK 的護城河更接近於一種基於優質資產和高效運營的『收費橋』模式，而非強勢品牌或網絡效應驅動的『特許經營』。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"VMRK's economic moat is generally moderate to strong, primarily relying on its asset positioning in specific geographic areas (M6) and excellent operational efficiency (M7). As a large residential REIT, its economies of scale (M5) and relatively sound capital allocation (M8) also provide certain competitive advantages. However, the company has weaker moats in brand pricing power (M1), switching costs (M3), network effects (M4), and customer retention (M9). The durability of its business model (M10) benefits from the fundamental need for housing, but it lacks protection from patents or exclusive licenses (M2). Overall, VMRK's moat is closer to a 'toll bridge' model based on quality assets and efficient operations, rather than a 'franchise' driven by a strong brand or network effects.","evidenceHash":"93f58870f94b4b6e4f8819718279c8670d82179b1e7c2e9eb8e922088e3bfa59","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T06:29:40.485Z","evidenceHash":"ada2389a7ab916c76f801291066acceb9aa777eda18aff4c3d3a05a0efa09ef1"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T06:29:40.485Z","evidenceHash":"ada2389a7ab916c76f801291066acceb9aa777eda18aff4c3d3a05a0efa09ef1"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VMRK.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VMRK.png","website":"https://www.equityapartments.com","ceo":"Benjamin W. Schall","full_time_employees":"3011","description":"Vivmark Residential is a real estate investment trust (REIT) and S&P 500 company formed through the August 2026 merger of equals between Equity Residential and AvalonBay Communities. The company focuses on the ownership, development, and management of high-quality apartment communities in premier U.S. markets, including major coastal cities and high-growth metro areas. Vivmark's portfolio consists of over 184,000 apartment homes with a substantial development pipeline. [25, 28, 40]","description_en":"Vivmark Residential is a real estate investment trust (REIT) and S&P 500 company formed through the August 2026 merger of equals between Equity Residential and AvalonBay Communities. The company focuses on the ownership, development, and management of high-quality apartment communities in premier U.S. markets, including major coastal cities and high-growth metro areas. Vivmark's portfolio consists of over 184,000 apartment homes with a substantial development pipeline. [25, 28, 40]","description_zh":"Vivmark Residential（美股代碼：VMRK）為 Real Estate 領域之重要企業，專注於 REIT - Residential 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Two North Riverside Plaza","city":"Chicago","state":"IL","zip":"60606","country":"US","phone":null,"full_address":"Two North Riverside Plaza, Chicago, IL 60606, US","range_52w":"57.57-71.5","year_high":71.5,"year_low":57.57,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":57.57,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-24","name":"NAUGHTON TIMOTHY J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-24","name":"MUELLER CHARLES E JR","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-11","n